---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Quality Assurance">
  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 border-b border-neutral-900 relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[-1] bg-neutral-950 flex items-center justify-center opacity-30">
      <span class="text-neutral-800 text-sm tracking-widest">[ ASSET PLACEHOLDER: QUALITY INSPECTION VISUAL ]</span>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-5xl z-10">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-12 leading-[0.9]">Elevating Precision to Excellence</h1>
      
      <p class="text-xl md:text-3xl text-neutral-300 font-light leading-relaxed mb-12">
        At Rupam Precision Engineering, quality is the cornerstone of everything we do. Our unwavering commitment to delivering precision components of exceptional quality sets us apart as a leader in the industry.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 border-b border-neutral-900">
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-16 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">Stringent Quality Control Procedures</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-neutral-800">
      <div class="md:px-8 pt-8 md:pt-0">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">Daily Productivity Reports</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed">Our commitment to precision begins with daily productivity reports. These reports provide us with real-time insights into the manufacturing process, allowing us to monitor progress, identify potential issues, and make adjustments as needed. This proactive approach ensures that we maintain consistency and efficiency in our production processes.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="md:px-8 pt-8 md:pt-0">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">Hourly Inspection Reports</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed">Precision is not left to chance; it's meticulously controlled through hourly inspection reports. Our skilled quality control team conducts thorough inspections at regular intervals throughout the manufacturing process. This includes checks for dimensions, tolerances, surface finish, and adherence to design specifications. Any deviations from the prescribed standards are addressed promptly to maintain the highest level of precision.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="md:px-8 pt-8 md:pt-0">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">Pre-Dispatch Reports (IS 2500)</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed">As part of our commitment to quality assurance, we adhere to IS 2500 Part 1 & Part 2 standards for pre-dispatch reports. These reports provide a detailed overview of the quality of each component before it leaves our facility. We ensure that every aspect of the component meets the stringent requirements outlined in these standards. This final inspection process guarantees that our clients receive components that are in perfect condition.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 border-b border-neutral-900 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
    <div class="space-y-16">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">Continuous Improvement Culture</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed">At Rupam Precision Engineering, quality is not just a process; it's a culture. We foster a culture of continuous improvement, where every team member is empowered to identify areas for enhancement and implement best practices. Our commitment to ongoing training and development ensures that our team remains at the forefront of industry standards and practices, allowing us to continuously raise the bar for quality.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">Investment in Advanced Technology</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed">To maintain our reputation for precision and excellence, we invest in cutting-edge technology and state-of-the-art quality control instruments. Our advanced equipment, including Coordinate Measuring Machines (CMM), Contracer measuring machines, height gauges, and roughness testers, is meticulously calibrated and maintained to guarantee accurate and reliable measurements. This investment in technology empowers us to consistently deliver components of exceptional quality.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="bg-neutral-900 h-full min-h-[400px] flex items-center justify-center p-12">
      <div class="max-w-md">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 text-white">Customer-Centric Quality Focus</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed mb-8">Our commitment to quality is driven by our dedication to customer satisfaction. We understand that our clients rely on the precision and reliability of our components to meet their own high standards. We work closely with our clients to understand their unique requirements, ensuring that our quality assurance processes are tailored to their specific needs.</p>
        <a href="/Rupam-Landing/contact/" class="border-b border-white pb-1 uppercase text-sm font-bold tracking-widest hover:text-neutral-400 hover:border-neutral-400 transition-colors inline-block">Experience the Assurance</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
